    "detailed_description": "You are an intern headed to a secret military lab. Your plane crashes into a helicopter on arrival and you are the only survivor. Now you must hunt down different items to survive. But it's not so simple. Use the W A S D keys to move around a vast environment searching for what you need to survive. Watch the shadows for the monster in the mist.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are being hunted while looking for scattered survival items. You are armed with only a flash light. Enjoy some thrills and jump scares as you hunt down things you need. All the items that glow are what you are looking for.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game has a foggy environment and plenty of jump scares. Explore the vast map, find the items you need to win. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMore levels to come in future releases.",
